note: let ... fixed makes a value that can never be changed. At the top level it is known in every action.
let pi be 3.14159 fixed
let tau be pi * 2 fixed
let title be "Space Game" fixed
let max_health be 100 fixed
let hard be true fixed
let negative be -5 fixed

action area takes(radius) do
    return pi * radius * radius
end

action heal takes(health, amount) do
    return min(health + amount, max_health)
end

action describe do
    if hard then
        return title + " (hard)"
    end
    return title
end

say describe()
say area(2)
say tau
say negative
say heal(90, 30)

note: fixed also works inside blocks and actions; there it is just read-only
let size be 4 fixed
repeat 2 times
    let step_size be size * 2 fixed
    say step_size
end
let names be list of text fixed
say size of names
